Set up Saral                                                         step 3 of 6

    Paste the API token

    -> ******************** 
    x Jira refused this token for you@example.com
    Either it was created under a different account, it has been revoked or
    has expired, or the organisation's policy blocks API tokens for managed
    accounts.

    Create one at id.atlassian.com/manage-profile/security/api-tokens. It is
    checked against the site before anything at all is written, and it never
    goes into the config file.